yName": "Gun Owners of America", "username": "GunOwners"}, "content": "\ud83d\udea8BREAKING\ud83d\udea8\n \nIt is 12:01 am on August 13th, 2026. @TheAKGuy & @WesVirdellTX are purchasing the first unregistered suppressors from @SilencerShop.\n\nThese GOA members will not be filing a Form 4 or complying with the other enjoined provisions of the National Firearms Act.\ud83d\udd25", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 2771}, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 213, "created": 1786599493000, "id": "2087775714091130926", "video": {"preview": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2087775521740394496/img/A7RO2Q3dg79FjohZ.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2087775521740394496/pl/KHCWZ_42UyosA1cw.m3u8?v=077", "aspectRatio": [9, 16], "heightRatio": 177, "type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2087775521740394496/vid/avc1/320x568/SuZfdj-t24P0_whE.mp4"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2012280176483196929/dXYKbX3w_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Gun Owners of America", "username": "GunOwners"}, "content": "\ud83d\udea8BREAKING\ud83d\udea8\n\nIt's official! @SilencerShop completed the first lawful, unregistered suppressor transfer since June 26th, 1934.\n\n@TheAKGuy's purchase was approved & @WesVirdellTX skipped the background check with his concealed carry permit. This is One Big Beautiful Victory. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83d\udd2b", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 12163}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCEB51rM", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 51, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "fight", "id": 8779268, "raw_content": "", "author": "try4gain", "created": 1786661834660, "profile_picture": "FHNIuGu0hRXm", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "SummTingWong", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user":